From 231ff8cccfb166ce465e5fa6d9e8007ecf9a4f56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gaudi port <gaudi-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:35:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] HPU DSA gather prefill: run the chunk loop outside the layer
 graph, one compiled recipe per chunk

Unrolled into the regional decoder-layer graph, the 30 chunks' gathered latents (~2 GiB each) were all held by
Synapse and warmup failed with 'Failed to allocate DRAM tensors'. The loop is now dynamo-disabled (KDA chunked
prefill precedent) and calls a static-shape compiled dsa_prefill_chunk kernel on 512-row blocks built from row
tensors, so no per-chunk recompiles; one-card 32k: 0.48 s per layer, device peak +3.7 GiB.

---
 vllm_gaudi/attention/oot_mla.py   | 34 +++++++++-------
 vllm_gaudi/ops/hpu_dsa_indexer.py | 65 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

